$ gragas journal --help
--- exit 0
--- stdout

  Every run that wrote on this folder keeps a record: what
  it
  meant to do, the copy of each file it replaced and how it
  ended. These commands read that record; nothing here asks
  a
  tool. The folder is named by a digest, never by its path.

    gragas journal list
    gragas journal recover --apply
    gragas journal restore <run>

  USAGE


    gragas journal [command] [--flags]


  COMMANDS

    list               List the runs that wrote here
    recover [--flags]  Roll back the runs that were
                       interrupted
    restore <run>      Print the lines that put a run's
                       files back

  FLAGS

    --accessible       Plain questions (ACCESSIBLE)
    --config           The settings file (GRAGAS_CONFIG)
    -h --help          Help for journal
    --json             Answer in one JSON document
    --no-color         No colour (NO_COLOR)
    --plain            Print plainly: nothing moves

--- stderr
